*[http://www.tweaktown.com/reviews/5472/corsair-voyager-air-500gb-wireless-storage-device-review/index.html ''Corsair Voyager Air'' Review on '''Tweaktown'''] : Battery: Li-ion, 3.7V, 6200mAh : USB 3.0 client based on [[ASMedia]] ASM1053
According to CPU datasheet: * Booting from HDD without Flash for the lower BOM cost (support of Flash is optional) * Two integrated SATA 3Gb/s ports with RAID0, RAID1, and JBOD support in hardware
